two instances of a portless subckt on VACASK, each feeding 1 A into its own resistor (7 and 9 ohm)
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model vamos_isource isource
model vamos_resistor resistor
subckt s2 ()
  parameters p3=1
  I1 (0 M1) vamos_isource type="dc" dc=1.0
  R1 (M1 0) vamos_resistor r=p3
ends
X2 () s2 p3=7
X3 () s2 p3=9
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  save v('X2:M1') v('X3:M1')
  analysis op1 op
endc
